{"format_version": 2, "segments": [{"kind": "text", "text": " ὄχθη, ἡ, older form of ὄχθος, any height or rising ground, natural or artificial, bank, dyke by the side of a river, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὑψηλὴν βάλεν ὄχθην Il. 21.171", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "172", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": in sg., also, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Plu. Publ. 16", "author_abbreviation": "Plu.", "tlg_author": "0007", "tlg_work": "008", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Arr. An. 1.14.4", "author_abbreviation": "Arr.", "tlg_author": "0074", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "CPHerm. 95.10", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (iii A. D.): mostly in pl., raised banks of a river, in full, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ποταμοῖο παρ' ὄχθας Il. 4.487", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "18.533", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "3.187", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "παρ' ὄχθῃσιν ποταμοῖο Od. 6.97", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Καφισοῦ παρ' ὄχθαις Pi. P. 4.46", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Xenoph. 2.21", "author_abbreviation": "Xenoph.", "tlg_author": "0267", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. Pr. 810", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Th. 392", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; ὄχθαι καπέτοιο the raised banks of the trench, dykes, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 15.356", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; also, heights beside the sea, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἁλὸς παρ' ὄχθας Od. 9.132", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ταὶ ὑπὲρ Κύμας ἁλιερκέες ὄ. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pi. P. 1.18", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "12.2", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; also of rising banks at a little distance from a river, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. An. 4.3.3", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " and "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "5", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": ὄχθη is distd. as the bank of a river, from ὄχθος a hill, in "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. Ph. 726", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "729", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (both lyr.); and this distn. generally holds, but in "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pi. P. 1.64", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " we read ὄχθαις ὑπὸ Ταϋγέτου; and in "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. Ant. 1132", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (lyr.), Νυσαίων ὀρέων ὄχθαι; reversely, we have in Sapph."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "p.44", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " Lobel, ὄχθοις Ἀχέροντος; in "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. Ag. 1161", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", Ἀχερουσίους ὄχθους; and in "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "E. Supp. 655", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "008", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", Ἰσμήνιον πρὸς ὄχθον; in late Prose, τὴν "}]}